# Zig build artifacts and local dependency/package caches. Unanchored on purpose:
# each guest package (l2-execution/, future rollup/, rollup-aggregation/, …) produces
# its own zig-out/, zig-pkg/, .zig-cache/, and .cache/ (e.g. l2-execution's
# .cache/large-ssz-fixtures/go-mod, a GOMODCACHE-style Go module cache) — these patterns cover them all.
.zig-cache/
zig-out/
zig-pkg/
.cache/
*.objdump
